    {
      "type": "modopedia:text",
      "x": 2,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 96,
      "line_height": 9,
      "text": "• Confirm the offhand contains gyromancy:mana_ink and is not empty.\n• Use Debug Brush dots to verify that the canvas accepts effect layers."
